		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Ici ca marche bien : </p><p>BEGIN<br />RAISE EXCEPTION &#039;test : %&#039;,&#039;toto&#039; || chr(10) || &#039;titi&#039;;<br />RETURN true;<br />END;</p><p>test=# select ftest();<br />ERROR:&#160; test : toto<br />titi</p>]]></content>
